ointe</surname><given-names>JY</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Coupling between transepithelial Na transport and basolateral K conductance in renal proximal tubule [editorial]</article-title><source>Am J Physiol</source><year>1994</year><volume>266</volume><fpage>F517</fpage><lpage>F527</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8184883</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Beck</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Breton</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Mairb&#x000e4;url</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Laprade</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Giebisch</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Relationship between sodium transport and intracellular ATP in isolated perfused rabbit proximal convoluted tubule</article-title><source>Am  J Physiol</source><year>1991a</year><volume>261</volume><fpage>F634</fpage><lpage>F639</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1928376</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Beck</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Breton</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Laprade</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Giebisch</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Volume regulation and intracellular calcium in the rabbit proximal convoluted tubule</article-title><source>Am J Physiol</source><year>1991b</year><volume>260</volume><fpage>F861</fpage><lpage>F867</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2058707</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Beck</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Breton</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><n